# OpenWrt packages loaded directly from Git repositories.
#
# Format:
# REPOSITORY [REF] [PATH]
#
# REPOSITORY  Required Git repository URL.
# REF         Optional branch, tag, or commit. Use - for the repository's
#             default branch when PATH is also specified.
# PATH        Optional package directory inside the repository. Default: .
#
# Examples:
#
# Package at the repository root, default branch:
# https://github.com/example/luci-app-example.git
#
# Package at the repository root, specific branch/tag/commit:
# https://github.com/example/luci-app-example.git main
#
# Package inside a larger repository:
# https://github.com/example/openwrt-apps.git main luci-app-example
#
# Package inside a larger repository using its default branch:
# https://github.com/example/openwrt-apps.git - luci-app-example
#
# Adding a Git source only makes the package available to OpenWrt. Add the
# package name to the `packages` file as well when it must be installed.
#
# Blank lines and comments starting with # are ignored.
